=base:main-content.cmark

# About

agents-exe is written by Lucas DiCioccio, who also writes about software at
[dicioccio.fr](https://dicioccio.fr/).

## A network of connected websites

This site is one of a family of small, related projects. They are built with
the same static-site generator and link to each other:

- [**dicioccio.fr**](https://dicioccio.fr/): the author's personal site and blog.
- [**kitchen-sink**](https://kitchensink-tech.github.io/): the static-site
  generator that builds this site.
- [**salmon**](https://lucasdicioccio.github.io/salmon/): a sibling project.
- [**tramaj**](https://lucasdicioccio.github.io/tramaj/): a sibling project.
- [**acme-not-a-joke**](https://lucasdicioccio.github.io/acme-not-a-joke/):
  another sibling project.

The source of agents-exe is on
[GitHub](https://github.com/lucasdicioccio/agents-exe).

